#: org.kde.merkuro.metainfo.xml:9
#. (itstool) path: component/name
msgid "Merkuro"
msgstr "बुधः"

#: org.kde.merkuro.metainfo.xml:10
#. (itstool) path: component/summary
msgid "Manage your tasks, events and contacts with speed and ease"
msgstr "स्वकार्यं, घटनां, सम्पर्कं च वेगेन, सहजतया च प्रबन्धयन्तु"

#: org.kde.merkuro.metainfo.xml:17
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"Merkuro is a calendar and contact application that allows you to manage "
"your tasks, events and contacts. Merkuro supports both local calendars as "
"well as a multitude of online calendars: Nextcloud, Google® Calendar, "
"Outlook®, Caldav, and many more."
msgstr ""
"Merkuro इति पञ्चाङ्गं सम्पर्क-अनुप्रयोगं च यत् भवान् स्वकार्यं, घटनां, "
"सम्पर्कं च प्रबन्धयितुं शक्नोति । Merkuro स्थानीयपञ्चाङ्गयोः समर्थनं करोति "
"तथा च अनेकानाम् ऑनलाइनपञ्चाङ्गानां समर्थनं करोति: Nextcloud, Google® "
"Calendar, Outlook®, Caldav, इत्यादीनि बहवः।"

#: org.kde.merkuro.metainfo.xml:18
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"Merkuro was built with the idea to be usable on desktop, on mobile and "
"everything in between."
msgstr ""
"मेरकुरो इत्यस्य निर्माणं डेस्कटॉप् इत्यत्र, मोबाईले, तदन्तरे सर्वं च "
"उपयोक्तुं शक्यते इति विचारेण कृतम् ।"

